  "content": "<p><strong>更新日誌</strong><br>More Golden Food 和 MNUF 1.0 版：新增了金甜菜根、金馬鈴薯、金螢光莓、金牛排、金熟豬排、金熟綿羊肉<br>More Golden Food 1.1 版：新增了金甜漿果，並修改了金螢光莓的合成配方。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1085569/description_cff900f6-6e0a-425e-8d55-b7bbd8034553.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"602\" height=\"350\"><br>金甜菜根 - 急迫 III（30 秒）<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1085569/description_53fd0f3c-f970-439d-a39b-5eff1e8292f6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"573\" height=\"339\"><br>金馬鈴薯 - 速度 III（10 秒）<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1085569/description_81b32c46-5945-4f0c-8784-834d48655589.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"612\" height=\"352\"><br>金螢光莓 - 夜視 II（30 秒）<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1085569/description_1271063e-7ef6-4416-be54-621849838b7a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"597\" height=\"326\"></p>\n<p>金熟豬排 - 抗性提升 II（15 秒）<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1085569/description_1905cd52-e24a-4724-9bb6-1d9f9cbfc07b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"614\" height=\"367\"><br>金熟綿羊肉 - 跳躍提升 III（17 秒）<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1085569/description_f8519ffc-de91-4930-aa96-3a5e0b096ebb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"609\" height=\"356\"><br>金牛排 - 生命恢復 IV（3 秒）<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1085569/description_9a8172ee-6f3b-4123-bb85-4b9455e14737.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"617\" height=\"364\"><br>金甜漿果 - 瞬間治療 II（3 秒）</p>",
